  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/63eghKx.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://badges.moddingx.org/curseforge/versions/503143\" alt=\"版本\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://badges.moddingx.org/curseforge/downloads/503143\" alt=\"下載量\"></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://imgur.com/7aKkpdc.png\" alt=\"\"></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Wireless-Redstone 是一款簡單的模組，用於無線傳輸紅石訊號。這對於大型紅石機關或長距離傳輸尤其方便。訊號甚至會在未載入的區塊中進行傳輸！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/nK9InFZ.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">無線傳輸紅石訊號</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">即使在未載入的區塊中也能運作</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">透過遠端啟動器，您可以從任何地方切換紅石輸出</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">透過多重發射器，您可以將無線訊號傳輸至多個接收器</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>使用方法</h2>\n<p>使用 WLR 連結器可以將 WLR 接收器與 WLR 發射器進行配對。操作方式為先右鍵點擊 WLR 接收器，再點擊對應的 WLR 發射器。發射器用於將輸入的紅石訊號傳送給接收器，隨後接收器便會輸出該訊號。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/TkiOVLY.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">接收器</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/416/345/310/172/2021-12-17_14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"145\"></p></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">發射器</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/416/346/310/172/2021-12-17_14.png\" width=\"310\" height=\"145\"></p></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">多重發射器</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/554/680/310/172/multiemitter.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"148\"></p></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">連結器</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/416/344/310/172/2021-12-17_14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"145\"></p></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">遠端控制器</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/554/681/310/172/remote_control.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"147\"></p></div>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/YoCQGH1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>歡迎瀏覽我們的 Discord。&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Um97SHnrYp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><img src=\"https://1000logos.net/wp-content/uploads/2020/10/Discord-logo-500x333.png\" alt=\"\"></em></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/MRUUxqO.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"100\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">也請看看我們的其它模組。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/invisible-lights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">隱形光線模組</span> </a></span> - 此模組加入了隱形光塊，幫助您更好地照亮您的世界。</p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/open-signals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">開放信號模組</span></a> - Open Signals 是一款 Minecraft 模組，加入了德國鐵路信號燈。這些信號燈與所有列車模組相容。</span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://imgur.com/VzLSHCb.png\" alt=\"\"></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>MrTroble – 開發者</p>\n<p>Jeronimo – 模型、紋理與開發</p>\n<p>TimeJudge – 助理開發者</p>",
